  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-DlLH1s4x\" id=\"link-0\">介绍</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-x04rnKvF\">客户在收到clickid/callback后进行转化归因时，由于存在多种归因逻辑，故期望客户能够把最终归上转化对应的归因方式上报到巨量引擎（例如本次转化是通过idfa归因，则回传该信息），以便一同监控归因设备ID的变化情况，异常时可以双方第一时间发现，减少归因gap损失。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ayd6qQdc\"><br/></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-JGTRNyL6\" id=\"link-1\">归因方式对应的枚举值</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t1e39d7f-oKn3UcIb\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-iY30QYrx\"><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-HKG6BuKZ\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-6BO0D0hq\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-8vy8U5JU\" span=\"1\" width=\"293%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-oVOePOOv\"><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-0vHVvhCl\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-EtmSGoOx\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-t9jKmJxH\"><strong>归因方式</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-cUC1Xrko\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Q25eKEDq\"><strong>枚举值</strong></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tcc17e07-26upzisT\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uOvABblH\"><strong>说明</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-9fMkTl6S\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-luoKA9Eb\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FUW1NgVH\">调起链接上的clickid</p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-mPBrBcty\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Y2LSCA5n\">uri_clickid</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tcc17e07-2MKR6R3O\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xQcL1ZlS\">一般在落地页、小程序、快应用的调起链接上会拼接clickid，客户可以根据用户转化情况将对应调起链接上的clickid上报给巨量，完成转化上报</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-hSxZTpHm\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-sF4y7wTh\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Y7l12JUF\">imei</p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-7v48b4VB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-C7gSb2Sl