 solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lNTRTqHu\">通过ipv4和ua(包括直接使用ua和解析ua中的关键信息)进行归因上的转化</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-hELn5WEF\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-utOlhfIv\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-edFB09Ed\">ipv6+ua</p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-PjOHv4ew\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kTA0A9tK\">ipv6+ua</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tcc17e07-OPnYic1R\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rZJngCgw\">通过ipv6和ua(包括直接使用ua和解析ua中的关键信息)进行归因上的转化</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-jANl8aki\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-DnosJRU0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2cjdv9mh\">time_fingerprint/paid</p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-fhpioHzQ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yOzDXLU5\">time_fingerprint</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tcc17e07-Kdjqc4KW\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-97EVBlRA\">通过time_fingerprint(宏参数: __TIME_FINGERPRINT__)或PAID(宏参数: __PAID__)归因上的转化</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-HaBL9sHF\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-bgB20yqm\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SRnkxqgE\">android_id</p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-FNPgl21m\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FSrLicmb\">android_id</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tcc17e07-2Na9iZMS\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rOaLHLeQ\">通过android id归因上的转化</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-UHxJjCFy\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-K7iXlxN8\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CaXQuGBu\">渠道包</p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-TMaNZ3tq\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TctMXDWE\">channel_package</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tcc17e07-PM2NyZpn\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gVTkDgUq\">通过渠道包(包含单独的包名或者在包里打入特定标识等方式)方式归因上的转化</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-Xiqh29xF\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-iW84F0Sg\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gsZxYrnS\">用户账户id</p></td><td data-id=\"t8b8e80e-ARArTNXp\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-LPZ29LUq\">customer_user_id</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tcc17e07-Rmfy58he\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RhkJCcUL\">通过客户内部账户体系归因到的转化</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t28b8a14-CJ5pCUlM\" style=\"height: 100%; width: 100%;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t114fa75-Y8O3ugRW\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5ojiYXVx\">手机号归因(PA)</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t114fa75-6NAizpXR\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sZUb7Qn0\">phone_num</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"tb3e6eab-nuaOGdb8\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qB7Hb7S8\">通过手机号归因到的转化</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-hNkk1B8B\"><br/></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-JWMgt3Ql\" id=\"link-2\">回传方式</h2><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-4d5jM4QW\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ftBWnjTm\"><strong>以下两个方案，客户可以根据目前的回传方式进行适配</strong></p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-PPsuocY7\"><strong>方案一：使用接口二回传</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-sEKn3aJV\">对接说明：https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710656359439</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-lsC6Oiyv\">上报地址：https://<a href=\"https://cloud.bytedance.net/tlb/archive/search/domain?keyword=ad.oceanengine.com\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">ad.oceanengine.com</span></a><span style=\"color: #245bdb;\">/track/activate</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-bhlS6gjn\">请求方式：GET</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-QB5EwIiX\">回传字段：attribute_key</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-8I7QaRr8\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-xTYanTr4\">示例：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-cPdpnXxf\">通过idfa归上了一个激活事件上报转化</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-jzzL3joD\">callback/clickid: EJiw267wvfQCGKf2g74ZIPD89-vIATAMOAFCIjIwMTkxMTI3MTQxMTEzMDEwMDI2MDc3MjE1MTUwNTczNTBIAQ==</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-5vXAx1ZM\">请求地址：https://ad.oceanengine.com/track/activate?callback=EJiw267wvfQCGKf2g74ZIPD89-vIATAMOAFCIjIwMTkxMTI3MTQxMTEzMDEwMDI2MDc3MjE1MTUwNTczNTBIAQ%3D%3D&amp;conv_time=1574835097&amp;event_type=0&amp;os=1&amp;idfa=FCD369C3-F622-44B8-AFDE-12065659F34B&amp;source=mybestcustom<span style=\"background-color: #b7edb1;\">&amp;attribute_key=idfa</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-XQAvqdx7\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-PueGaBYa\"><strong>方案二：使用事件管理api回传</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-HTn623XX\">对接说明：https://event-manager.oceanengine.com/docs/8650/app_api_docs/</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-WRrJbGUE\">上报地址：https://analytics.oceanengine.com/api/v2/conversion</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-28ZQNvfv\">请求方式：POST</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Mt0WFUxg\">content-type：application/json</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-HbPHqdnD\">回传字段：attribute_key</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-UMNHmyJT\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-l1QQTOjQ\">示例：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-byihJJyG\">通过idfa归上了一个激活事件</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-kgLTYT36\">callback/clickid：EJiw267wvfQCGKf2g74ZIPD89-vIATAMOAFCIjIwMTkxMTI3MTQxMTEzMDEwMDI2MDc3MjE1MTUwNTczNTBIAQ==</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-kh1O8mKa\"><br/></p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22javascript%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22curl%20-X%20POST%20'https%3A%2F%2Fanalytics.oceanengine.com%2Fapi%2Fv2%2Fconversion'%20%5C%5C%5Cn-H%20'Content-Type%3A%20application%2Fjson'%20%5C%5C%5Cn-d%20'%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22event_type%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22active%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22context%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22ad%5C%